    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISSCUSSION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/8d2d8dfb11e2669606a7413f3694b03a.poster.avif?t=1750645331\" width=800 height=357 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/8d2d8dfb11e2669606a7413f3694b03a.webm?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/30eba8a27adebf3f97b85746419dc281.poster.avif?t=1750645331\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/30eba8a27adebf3f97b85746419dc281.webm?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/30eba8a27adebf3f97b85746419dc281.mp4?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Four mysterious women, one enigmatic invitation. A grand castle becomes the stage for a deadly game\u2014a mix of <strong>Russian Roulette and identity deception</strong>. Lies, death, and strategy rule the table. With a revolver in hand, use cunning tools, every bullet could be your last. Are you ready for the ultimate <strong>first-person multiplayer online</strong> experience?]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/0cefbdff7d0ee08d1ebcba2fa64d3da1.poster.avif?t=1750645331\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/0cefbdff7d0ee08d1ebcba2fa64d3da1.webm?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/0cefbdff7d0ee08d1ebcba2fa64d3da1.mp4?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udf19 </strong>\u201cNight phase begins. Close your eyes\u201c \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/b50e04b9650b35540730018f30c3776b.poster.avif?t=1750645331\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/b50e04b9650b35540730018f30c3776b.webm?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/b50e04b9650b35540730018f30c3776b.mp4?t=1750645331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 <strong>Classic gameplay innovation</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2bBasic rules: Four players participate in Russian roulette, and each pull of the trigger is a 50% chance of survival \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0Prop matching: Unique prop mechanism, which can affect the entire battle at any time \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0fParadox victory: Heretic will win immediately after ending themselves \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2605 <strong>Deadly reasoning link</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0cFirst night prophecy: Please close your eyes when it gets dark-all players get an identity verification opportunity \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Each round is a 15-20 minute high-intensity psychological game \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25b6 Supports 4-player online confrontation, and each round randomly obtains a unique identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Special execution animations that make people feeling hot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > [Character Introduction] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc67[Saori] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/4e888474992409593fd764b33b89d2ec.avif?t=1750645331\" width=612 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She looks innocent and a good girl in the eyes of people around her. No one would have thought of her true identity - a vampire! Or rather, everyone who knew this secret disappeared quietly. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f[Vela Kolt] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/9bcc9cac61450087f76206b53a75820e.avif?t=1750645331\" width=612 height=1104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everyone thinks that this policewoman is too strong, but they don't know that she has a masochistic habit in private. Her true identity is a wolf hidden among humans. When she is emotional, her ears and tail will be exposed. \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea1[Nicky] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/04e770e7ee3985441ff2d52314a218b1.avif?t=1750645331\" width=612 height=1104 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traces of stitches on her face make it hard to imagine what she has been through. Her empty words and mechanical movements make people feel a little cold when talking to her. \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ea\ufe0f[Isabelle] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/dc5365a20e8bdafc27d9f1e4f24d1d31.avif?t=1750645331\" width=612 height=1104 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tall nun. According to rumors, no man can stare at her for three seconds. Because men who see her can't move but boner... She always wears a top hat on weekdays, making it difficult to see her expression. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>[Developer Warning] \u00a0 \u26a0\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may cause: \u2713Permanent damage to trust between friends</p>",
